    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dan, Kelliah et Louis sont trois \u00e9tudiants d'une des meilleures \u00e9coles de commerce de France. Ils sont form\u00e9s pour devenir l\u2019\u00e9lite de demain et sont bien d\u00e9cid\u00e9s \u00e0 passer rapidement de la th\u00e9orie \u00e0 la pratique. Alors que les lois du march\u00e9 semblent s\u2019appliquer jusqu\u2019aux relations entre gar\u00e7ons et filles, ils vont transformer leur campus en lieu d\u2019\u00e9tude et d\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation. La cr\u00e8me de la cr\u00e8me de la jeunesse fran\u00e7aise s'amuse et profite pleinement de ses privil\u00e8ges : tout se vend car tout s\u2019ach\u00e8te\u2026 mais dans quelle limite ?",
        "english": "Dan, Kelliah, and Louis are three students at one of France's best business colleges. They have been trained to become tomorrow's elite and are determined to rapidly pass from theory into practice. Market rules can be applied to everything, even to the relations between men and women, and they will transform the campus into a study and experimentation site. The elite of French youth has fun and fully enjoys its privileged position: everything can be bought and sold - but who sets the limits?"
